benchmarks/data/SPR.json, DrQ(eps).json, and IRIS.json contain published Atari
100k results. Their pinned source, checksums, and run counts are documented in
benchmarks/data/PROVENANCE.md. The underlying data belongs to its original authors.

benchmarks/data/atari_100k_baselines.json contains random and human score
baselines extracted from the rliable notebook by Google Research. rliable is
licensed under Apache License 2.0. The notebook revision, extraction checksum,
and source license link are documented in benchmarks/README.md.
